WEBVTT

00:08:00.083 --> 00:08:02.518
and host community events.

00:08:02.542 --> 00:08:05.226
The intention is
to build financial capital

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:07.208
and creative capital in our hood.

00:08:09.292 --> 00:08:11.601
We're also collaborating
with world-renowned chef

00:08:11.625 --> 00:08:14.226
Massimo Bottura

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:16.601
on a refettorio in the Bronx.

00:08:16.625 --> 00:08:21.434
A refettorio is a design-focused
soup kitchen and community center.

00:08:21.458 --> 00:08:22.726
You see the vibes.

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:26.208
(Applause)

00:08:28.917 --> 00:08:32.143
The recent outpouring of grief
about the murder